{"id":"kobr3ff3pyekhft755q53ups0","title":"欧洲央行提议扩大小型银行监管框架适用范围","originalTitle":"Frank Elderson: Smart supervision for small banks","summary":"欧洲央行副行长Frank Elderson在11月16日发表评论称，拟将监管框架适用的小型银行资产负债表上限从5亿欧元提高至10亿欧元（视风险情况），并重新定义'非复杂'银行标准，使更多银行受益于简化监管。改革将减少小型银行30%的监管数据报送量，同时通过集中执行压力测试降低机构负担。文章强调监管调整需保持安全标准，支持欧洲银行体系在竞争力与抗风险能力间取得平衡。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"欧洲央行新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.ecb.europa.eu//press/inter/date/2026/html/ecb.in261116_1~11dd7f62af.en.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T13:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T17:00:05.248Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T17:00:05.248Z","category":"crypto-policy","tags":["政策发布","监管处罚"],"score":56,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"regulation","name":"监管与政策"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}